# Feature views — template slots only

Read `docs/specs/2026-08-31-page-architectures.md` before any UI work.

## Rules

1. One PageTemplate per page — `Landing | Editorial | Hub | Feed | Schedule | Article | Form | Notice`.
2. **Slots only** — build records with `landingSlots` / `hubSlots` / `editorialSlots` / `feedSlots` / `articleSlots` / `scheduleSlots` / form field records.
3. **No primitives in features** — no `import App.Ui.Card`, no `class_` (`make gate`). View/Components import prefixes are `Policy.Contract.featureViewImportAllowlist`.
4. **Copy exemplars** — `Home`, `About`, `Guarantees`, `Docs` views; do not invent layout.
5. **DaisyUI HTML lives in `App.Ui.Templates` / `App.Ui` primitives** — not in feature views.

```purescript
-- ❌ BAD — class soup or primitives in a feature
el "div" [ class_ "grid gap-6" ] [ … ]

-- ✅ GOOD — closed template
renderPage lang Home status (Landing (landingSlots …))
```
